  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a name=\"top\"></a></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Combat&amp;Jobs</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:60%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_steal/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">훔치기(Stealing)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_hiding/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">숨기(Hiding) \n                             \n                            </font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_stealth/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">은폐이동(Stealth)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_snooping/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">훔쳐보기(Snooping)</font></a></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">은폐탐지(Detect Hidden)</font></span></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellspacing=\"0\" height=\"85\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"right\" class=\"heading\" height=\"565\" width=\"595\"> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:5; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스누핑은</span></b></font><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> 다른 플레이어나 \n\n                            Npc의 가방을 열어 볼수 잇는 스킬을 말합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">몬스터도 가방을 \n\n                            가지고 있지만 캐릭창이 뜨지를 않기 때문에 스누핑을</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">할수 없다는 \n\n                            전설이 있습니다-\"-</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일단 스누핑을 \n\n                            할려면 대상물에 가까이 접근해야 합니다.위의 사진에서 \n\n                            보시는바와같이</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">원하는 플레이어의 \n\n                            캐릭을 더블클릭 해줍니다</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"1\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/combat/steal/snoooing_2.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"142\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:198/142\" width=\"198\"></span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이렇게</span></b></font><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> 캐릭창이 \n\n                            나오면 캐릭창에 잇는 상대방의 가방을 또 더블클릭 \n\n                            해줍니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이때 자신의 \n\n                            카르마는 떨어지면서 성공시 가방이 열립니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 스킬이 \n\n                            낮을 때에는 좌측에 실패 메시지만 뜨고 가방이 안열리지만</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">계속 가방을 \n\n                            뒤지시고 스킬이 오르면서 언젠가는 상대방의 \n\n                            가방이 열립니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"1\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill_index/images/combat/steal/snoooing_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"142\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:198/142\" width=\"198\"></span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일단</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> </span></font><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">상대방의 \n\n                            가방이 열렸을 때 원하는 아이템을 훔치는 스틸링스킬과 \n\n                            연동하여 훔치는 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">목표를 달성 해주시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 스누핑도 \n\n                            스킬이기 때문에 초기 낮은 스킬에 스누핑을 하게되면</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">상대방의 화면 \n\n                            좌측에 누가 가방을 뒤지고 있다는 불순한 메시지가 \n\n                            뜹니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 그 플레이어는 \n\n                            경계심을 늦추지 않게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">훔칠 입장에 \n\n                            있는 도둑은 그리 달갑지 않은 메시지 일 것입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스누핑이</span></b></font><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> 높은 수치에 \n\n                            오를수록 그런 메시지가 뜨지 않으므로 플레이어를 \n\n                            위한 스틸을 위해선 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스누핑도 어느정도 단계까지는 \n\n                            올리시는 것도 좋습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 한번의 \n\n                            더블클릭만으로 상대방의 가방이 열린다는 것도 좋은 느낌을 \n\n                            가지게 될것입니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#262626\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Written By \n\n                        Forg</span></b></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"298\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:8;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_skill/\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/menu.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"295\">\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"#top\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/top.gif\" width=\"20\"></font></span></b></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_b.gif\" height=\"20\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/b_logo.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n"
